<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-SOUTH AUSTRALIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AUSTRALIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round</p>
<p>scores from the South Australian Open golf tournament at the</p>
<p>par-72 Kooyonga course on Thursday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>67 Gary Simpson, Shane Tait, Grant Dodd</p>
<p>68 Brett Ogle, Neil Kerry, Craig Parry, Matthew Goggin,</p>
<p>Tom Lehman (U.S.)</p>
<p>69 David Ecob, Jason Evans, Bradley Forrester,</p>
<p>Jean-Louis Guepy (France), Peter O'Malley, Michael</p>
<p>Long (New Zealand), Tim Elliott, Robert Farley,</p>
<p>Pierre Fulke (Sweden)</p>
<p>70 Ashley Andrews, David Hill, Doug Dunakey (U.S.),</p>
<p>Jason Norris, Greg Chalmers, Stephen Collins, Michael</p>
<p>Harwood, Robert Allenby, Kenny Druce, Terry Price,</p>
<p>Jens Nilsson (Sweden)</p>
<p>Other selected scores:</p>
<p>71 Ian Baker-Finch, Raymond Russell (Britain), Paul</p>
<p>Devenport (New Zealand), Elliot Boult (New Zealand)</p>
<p>72 Wayne Grady, Steve Alker (New Zealand)</p>
<p>73 Ben Jackson (Britain)</p>
<p>75 Tommy Nakajima (Japan)</p>
</text>
